#! ia 1.0

@schema layer
  lowers to definition
  sections
    must have meaning
    must have layer
    may have relationships
    closed
  fields
    must have meaning.says as text
    may have meaning.answers as text
    must have layer.rank as number "Dependency rank: packages and layers depend only downward along lower ranks."
    must have layer.title as text
    may have layer.paths as list of text "Repository-relative path prefixes assigned to this layer; omitted on reusable path-less layer profiles."
    may have layer.policy as text "Summary of what belongs in this layer and what may not enter it."
    may have layer.repository as ref to repository
  edges
    may require layer one-or-more
